      "english": "What's this big news?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C0EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "951504deb0a42b5a35a7fd743d7a8d9d571f41c16eaf02283d2626acfe70e506",
      "english": "Yeah, pricey place. Heard old man Matsudaira's a regular.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C158",
      "source_words_sha256": "09d448a1e6085ffbb7d20e792afdab4db3982ddea9ceabfb6eac37f844f63a3d",
      "english": "What?! Is that reliable?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C180",
