      "english": "And?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C190",
      "source_words_sha256": "ab6a9e7bce2030ef10815c59e30d9f4936585ff1f3423a1284e743376497d01f",
      "english": "Gin Tama? What's that got to do with Joi rebels...? ...Oh!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C1DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "2b1223ac59b4a6a70cce641484916d8004747a516d73f5223d59bf713f196cf7",
      "english": "One more time, Sougo... This isn't a false tip, right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C218",
