      "english": "...No, Kondo. This works in our favor.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C2C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "6a2090eccd7839f115b3e24e0b7cf94922a12e2fbf96d4c8e816541c35e84f0a",
      "english": "...But I'll go alone. If that excuse doesn't hold up, it's a clear breach of the code.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C328",
      "source_words_sha256": "07afc7dff020ce6346804d2cfa4f5271b24ff7987db3782a02bb2923b1653abb",
      "english": "That's why I should go alone...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C350",
      "source_words_sha256": "38e3ac5541c11dc3afe2feabd4429acb4f0dca1e712009d7d199045e7a8dfd9e",
      "english": "Idiot! That's not it!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C378",
      "source_words_sha256": "233a4f786d4deb6062a39f4d5fcdc3ed6aa86ae97241d72cbf37a7b2645a0e62",
      "english": "...Kondo. But...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C3A8",
      "source_words_sha256": "5921d39c5bf497a861abd312e7bb5321f448d4a997f70f74d1dbfa74af15e80c",
      "english": "...I give in, Kondo. Sougo. Fine, let's raise hell together.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C3F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "e6207b0052d39a7ac092e59fa23f2e51ff6c8bef4c8a9a545d9b71b7c2395df6",
      "english": "Shinsengumi, assemble!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C40C",
      "source_words_sha256": "52a6f7e2e8d1f51abbcdccd79856d965374a52080189005939db306df75bd57e",
      "english": "If you're fired up, quit the badminton!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C488",
      "source_words_sha256": "7803048c020e5672576209fb006e077b91cae6496b17afda24219d5eedcfebd7",
      "english": "Storm in as soon as we signal.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C4AC",
      "source_words_sha256": "132a479876bbbcb298930a5dd8ef33659f038220a3be355148fd08398d0e61e4",
      "english": "Exactly.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C4BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "6acefecf2769b04865041031cfddde9e085af16601a045359c80273ad9b30c47",
      "english": "What's wrong, Sougo? At this hour...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C500",
      "source_words_sha256": "511885a23590d511bb5241998db5d9266852d3d66ab188c49c3f145b1a340c9d",
      "english": "Oh, right. Katsura seemed to be collecting Gin Tama.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C580",
      "source_words_sha256": "dc24df912edc8cf889c10037f8fd8e4e02adfbf5abfc770ab3a8f9ce676220db",
      "english": "Handy?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C58C",
      "source_words_sha256": "5eb304fb5f7e47464dc57b3333965bbcf4d4f1d6dc56f9a7b445567635f3ae42",
      "english": "Huh...? ...Oh!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C5B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "44d2e78ae15bd51e1ef6c1c2e2617f5f520b9524582f729bf6d3392cb3333c05",
      "english": "I see. Hah! Clever, you two.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C6DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "b517b1b4578e911e4a79b1235cf1f6d2153ae3879594a2b67589287860b36d52",
      "english": "Right! Move out!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C6F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "db975526db3d87294f49c7ed9a471f71b3bd20ebb96e208c10ada101483969df",
      "english": "Busy day, huh.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C70C",
      "source_words_sha256": "b32ff1123cda80e58afb64da7d3d5f5a027614668902af4aefc4fcce4be60986",
      "english": "Got some big news.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C7E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "f036721a1683d0ded5d4b1e64e31a4ae46b3c44afa96d4e7c27027a2e16de4ae",
      "english": "...Seems that meeting involves Gin Tama.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C82C",
      "source_words_sha256": "018e338f30f1a91ed1400bc25d29ff6c366cc5bf3730e8de525e6e3b71f7dabd",
      "english": "Right, Hijikata. Before, that bastard Katsura...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C88C",
      "source_words_sha256": "43117da593fd2286070c9d3dc86ebaa1b9ab1c1a3f503663cd18593cef95f92b",
      "english": "Right, Kondo. We're going to arrest Joi rebels, aren't we?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C8D4",
      "source_words_sha256": "b2ecec8813d11664a2b7448406ebd73e7a062d419e1652a7e45fd2cc4f41853f",
      "english": "What, Hijikata? Hogging all the fun? Not fair.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C91C",
      "source_words_sha256": "bdef7de620b94baac895173271860210f8376d1154a07988bbb81266afe97e58",
      "english": "That's right, Hijikata.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C938",
      "source_words_sha256": "1a49fab306f39d651bcfeb141926b9c5c26545a6820f099fbec02f3ea572be58",
      "english": "Right! Settled!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C950",
      "source_words_sha256": "0d7dad07f51d02a3433d5fd52bc6b46b81f071b861309620910fab20fd8dd09d",
      "english": "All present! Ready to move out!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C9A8",
      "source_words_sha256": "c21b32c3f1c44b23568b7c22357bfbcf933f080369a494dc127c1c80ce0ecb2b",
      "english": "What is it?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C9BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "a33b3d5dd7d6a21b9fe3cb3252439bee6a6dc83f27ac915bb3ddb7883ef06623",
      "english": "Joi rebels?! Don't be ridiculous! Has to be a hoax!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005C9F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "64510cda918fb60f48a26f06869c259cba59b67663bf073449cfe6283d956b40",
      "english": "Wait! Important guests here today!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CA28",
      "source_words_sha256": "923974f6856b720bed0a73d528b2c653a606861d0bf5125a94e21468e0a709b5",
      "english": "Then it's even worse! REALLY bad!\fPlease don't cause trouble here! I'm serious!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CA9C",
      "source_words_sha256": "1b528a9c73dc4f1f74254bd3a506dbf9465c4f150929ba402c2561b7db4f7a1b",
      "english": "It's complicated, okay!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CABC",
      "source_words_sha256": "e995f19c9cee85b2e456dd5847f6afff295f3160521b2804b6f8e8bd6813a01f",
      "english": "No way!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CACC",
      "source_words_sha256": "bfee416ea08ccdacb811554f8ff148ebd88703c03617165b50b654214e7127ae",
      "english": "You are NOT getting past!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CAE8",
      "source_words_sha256": "aead262766153901f544052b4b0ee18730aae59e7d51a82a470c105231a3c8c4",
      "english": "Then beat me before you go through!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CB10",
      "source_words_sha256": "78d8ffaf8d3ea50adf25c374a70c18ed5a9063d824340d26957425c278001ee2",
      "english": "My dreeeam!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CB28",
      "source_words_sha256": "21b902637fd086d9b55f2a2b608681eab80c46f72669d24eb2f1f2a6cafb43b4",
      "english": "What do YOU know?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CB44",
      "source_words_sha256": "31f55bb0da751e847afee0a327c11c6edece2522765ef265ffa2e911aae0f895",
      "english": "Idiot! Dreams aren't just for dreaming!\fYou make them COME TRUE!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CB88",
      "source_words_sha256": "72f20a2082ebbb65ae259c366406fbfe6d675695dba76ecaa18b88e09d0f1c4c",
      "english": "Waaah! DREAM COME TRUE!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CBB8",
      "source_words_sha256": "b9b86a08a0aa37fb8dd49573f0d63f526ade7900643788e4be10f8a9af4d6db8",
      "english": "Yes! I won! I fought for my dream and WON!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CBF8",
      "source_words_sha256": "0f2a73578dddf4eb3d156a75320b3c8c6c77865b067971c1536923b3a454cfde",
      "english": "Feel like I could fire a Kamehameha today!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CC2C",
      "source_words_sha256": "e4804a28b660a83d809ff2bf6b0839a5b4ac3704d4bf4854aa9b09577ff9ef55",
      "english": "KA!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CC38",
      "source_words_sha256": "bcf3aab448b7e6cb464f9f0a18ec976b3cd0659c57bad612e20bf0a1ae9c29fd",
      "english": "ME!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CC44",
      "source_words_sha256": "5ca73627c6dd63c6e146fa41d218bad86aacea2cb248887d18f3081a6f4b24d7",
      "english": "HA!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CC5C",
      "source_words_sha256": "d39447c64c1731806eec92d90b8b029dc2889d1d3c2392ed9bd0737aec076355",
      "english": "HA!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CC68",
      "source_words_sha256": "7847b64730851e49f9aaf2960ccf6af03fced471a56e3e3f3f8090339e01e623",
      "english": "Shinsengumi! Official inspection!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CCBC",
      "source_words_sha256": "f3f659bd0ba817376e96d426d8c726c2784ddf3643c28fb2466b676d32cf7a22",
      "english": "Bad guys among those guests!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CCE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "617383a555d2a9a36f6362a53fd0eeb75b81cb7b36f9cf28f65030d3cbe04d67",
      "english": "Like I care about your problems!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CD54",
      "source_words_sha256": "9baf30dadafd2ae8824a5502514bd6278e059bc9bd63c3611ed39af472ab06f8",
      "english": "We're going through.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CDA0",
      "source_words_sha256": "7604b97bfd456541caed1aed7d5e487afc5b25e1f9d66f5a37356a41e54c7642",
      "english": "I get it. We're going through.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CDC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "13c9820aa0cf76db658bc87c3589bf846ecf7647b2738061736a94456d3adda8",
      "english": "Leave him! Let's go!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CDE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "dc388e30fedcadfe6ea6b54fed7b8977ebcbca278912eb42ead9a1227047631b",
      "english": "No idea what's going on... Is he okay?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CE1C",
      "source_words_sha256": "48a06c16b1aed5897225148aa658242dfb180a7f36374e78d748e1e4bded31d7",
      "english": "Seriously...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CE34",
      "source_words_sha256": "47c0e4fc0a39995fdbbb9a12b7f87e92dee7fa4e15a39adb59fe14b5e257e279",
      "english": "What's so bad, exactly?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CE4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "d14f32d7660bc0d3b1a98f26462f3e8816dd284022d3ee1551dcc0fc952fe8ab",
      "english": "Can't we at least hear him out?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CE7C",
      "source_words_sha256": "92895323e551b91b40ebbdd6dbd8f257ff32f3360df673bea5a7f90b0a85850a",
      "english": "Is this old man okay?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CE9C",
      "source_words_sha256": "ba317d518389823ab59d5804a2f313aed91f70a33250544f2c07aea812fa47fc",
      "english": "Come on! Let's go!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CEF8",
      "source_words_sha256": "29f906981ba4668d420920350fdb084be056e7071fdc56cbd4806c177aae5c82",
      "english": "Investigate and we'll know if it's a hoax.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CF24",
      "source_words_sha256": "85ee7cd7151d0c82db5354306ee477c70182730de296175b75a9f35048121377",
      "english": "No dreams at your age...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CF40",
      "source_words_sha256": "d8845b7c00aa2af309709e7e5a91d21aeefaffd98bb6561592aba63a7b92a2f8",
      "english": "All set! Ready anytime!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CF8C",
      "source_words_sha256": "3f02e6c2d562ee75515e0784717e1aecffdf27702e550971f3ae18b6dcf09c63",
      "english": "Who are you?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CFA0",
      "source_words_sha256": "827291335b31850671a8144bd7529b62fde060b9f6cd81b677093ea0e3894f51",
      "english": "Michael! Just got out of jail, didn't you?! Don't tell me...!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005CFF0",
      "source_words_sha256": "8fa2fe4c68be7ee8d64f10a8279957f12602e717aff477f207860b27fe26bfbd",
      "english": "You a Joi rebel?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D020",
      "source_words_sha256": "0220bfab3da1580ab7f7059c6dd002979ca4a006da54a535b77afb6703f885bb",
      "english": "Liar! You're selling THAT, right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D044",
      "source_words_sha256": "62262289df2b120aaf811ba17634c83f6f22088c14ebc68beddef54b6205ca84",
      "english": "A show? What kind?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D0A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "c4e58e4c84d0d8cb258116aca4cf34302892c23283cb523fd3fdf0ffe1ba078d",
      "english": "Then WHO decides?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D0C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "9b879bf19aae1c8f478eb17e903032e5cf85bc2b6a4f1ab0d4ec4d657414d91e",
      "english": "TV dealing with Joi rebels? Shocking.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D0E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "235f143f8291b267e6a345dceda7976877a351c35e6d523b360e6929b23b7ad2",
      "english": "Don't lie, bastard!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D10C",
      "source_words_sha256": "d82e1aa3a1dcbb7588fe20be367f512ec7f68fbce1b0c9a11c8d4f012e4b247a",
      "english": "Don't play dumb!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D12C",
      "source_words_sha256": "d3204c34525545d00c8b60045daae1e5e3ab03fd8e588c8a80b821029d3e8add",
      "english": "Who's that?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D140",
      "source_words_sha256": "dc43f386c6f93d1432551dc6616b900c65cb264950003eeb8164a5e8096dd96c",
      "english": "A cyborg?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D154",
      "source_words_sha256": "0405b29ad1ebb10f8c0fe97b4c692606372cf14dc1be4babb7557e7061ffa263",
      "english": "A key witness. Take him in!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D170",
      "source_words_sha256": "0c01ee1fb8ee1b3b8eeac2e40d89890150f6d67adb27dfbdbbf3de95403aee7f",
      "english": "Quiet! Quit the nonsense!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D198",
      "source_words_sha256": "70752e17222ee0a4d299841b5f13de54d1af13e1d19c1c2f0c87e4feb09d2948",
      "english": "Obviously suspicious.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D1B0",
      "source_words_sha256": "a1bdce8bbbcfbce415a15a08e1d7e060bfd661f7a01780265baf0d611981d086",
      "english": "So you sell more than faulty goods... Give it up!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D1E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "f7ab7ba3efc66a602ecd84eb0ec2a963b444236fd7a6ecc2aa8448441bb17db7",
      "english": "Wait... YOU'RE the dealer?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D210",
      "source_words_sha256": "be66b4220613f87e64732519f250941693441e49470c7d4c05cc42a28c889453",
      "english": "You're the dealer?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D228",
      "source_words_sha256": "b58f363782132c92aa758157e1d411e68fd8c291f15aa5384a1683b6e4e0a243",
      "english": "Where do you sell it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D29C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2ca73e05a45d067ef23d43a39cb75055e90520cce16a335fb71a53a9766046dc",
      "english": "Not too loud, but... I use it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D2C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "05d439e9cc25bd1b6ab414b9f87646f0fac4dee72b20385918430399f76d2fa2",
      "english": "A TV station's involved?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D2E0",
      "source_words_sha256": "7287ae4dd4b2082bfe5b2c0ea0189e59d5d8bc5f63e19ab67227887662667e6b",
      "english": "Ouch! What the hell?!\fGot a date with Jennifer today!\fFirst the weird staff, now Shinsengumi! Just my luck! SHIT!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D378",
      "source_words_sha256": "c311d507cb4e7f56223c915eba0098089560e5766e43b9d6535f2e9c6628eb8f",
      "english": "Waiting for my girlfriend Jennifer.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D3A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "62f2e3068bdb00d161afc84fe269ba24ecfdc6ba1caf7cce257c1020b746ad66",
      "english": "No! Not like that!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D3C4",
      "source_words_sha256": "8c08278190f241a52b4b9936bb5770595f42a83de54e5b0a74e470c8bc6527f8",
      "english": "Well, yes, I DO sell things...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D420",
      "source_words_sha256": "74e48dbac9bd14b3a1c915128fad652e5e2d8dbdf6011aeaa1d08ff28cd25fe6",
      "english": "Never heard of that!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D43C",
      "source_words_sha256": "a0d2dd2c95bb114e812454385e074babd17697d19635a54d38e6162983680c5f",
      "english": "What's THAT? I sell all sorts! Be specific!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D474",
      "source_words_sha256": "e89dd6a57d79a10f37d7d06e4783edb1f161f4ff62433223b2788cf4da10024b",
      "english": "A TV show! The one I'm on!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D4C4",
      "source_words_sha256": "a5bae580eb3b88e987855594bbff9cb154a7df0c6d13fc9dcf85db2b12a35eaf",
      "english": "You use it too?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D4E0",
      "source_words_sha256": "15251f7a0713651ffa08322d172850a881498b9f4ccefceb5c71de316c477fd1",
      "english": "That? Oh, THAT! You use it too?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D5A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "e1c9ac30dc4384deac8dd6d75deff98a167a1e26d73b65af6ee7b694a59253cf",
      "english": "The TV station!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D5B8",
      "source_words_sha256": "fd03769ba6694b8127772f69833ce160a49cd5b10eadea922c3f6995d5d6be23",
      "english": "I don't know anything! They must've tricked me!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D5EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "a00dbe37f9125499eac65459551a5b664863261f274289e8624a6750b1738dec",
      "english": "Unbelievable! I'm not lying!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D614",
      "source_words_sha256": "2492eec5f85c0261d155a488a6ecdfd3c82f31d2d366b704d0d6a9c80ffaff7c",
      "english": "Oh, right! There IS someone suspicious!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D63C",
      "source_words_sha256": "aa3a9e1f4cca0589dffc1c31674268c226c595682de3eed5fea477c7b5bffe36",
      "english": "My co-star Marilyn!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D65C",
      "source_words_sha256": "e5ebcca2796c0b62370e24e818196ecf96ae459823782ecdbac79e004096566d",
      "english": "She's had her face done! No, her whole body's modified!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D690",
      "source_words_sha256": "cf1d3a30a0f28328bcdc96dda561b98159dd0703ef1e2d119ed85e14e27bffc8",
      "english": "SHE was a dealer for a criminal organization?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D704",
      "source_words_sha256": "b84e29f72bb670be8140fd1127a9a9bcc897cd18bc65a595b5ce78b43d62a11f",
      "english": "Oh my God!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D718",
      "source_words_sha256": "c99d454fcc7f27e1b3adc9a16bef229094de9cbed7fc55839134f549f8c9f235",
      "english": "Quit struggling!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D730",
      "source_words_sha256": "1001edd8a50ec6b2300f312ac41fd11ef09239646e4c99d448bbd384c16b55c5",
      "english": "Alone?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D740",
      "source_words_sha256": "4f79f02c596280b66526f982a6717b50ac88b0c51d6c20684f341251cdbbd3ab",
      "english": "Acting alone?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D754",
      "source_words_sha256": "64d682ba6501fc7834f6602762ae2a5b418bb9ea84281a9926086e78afed1264",
      "english": "Doesn't look like a ronin.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D770",
      "source_words_sha256": "3296347e1b35365461b054815539253be140a89709187c6f99a79f28c9d6c466",
      "english": "Suspected Joi connections. Don't resist!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D7C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "9c54e167c651cb36372bbf959981e5c6997d463f0d4a9e5a46628a37875dee9f",
      "english": "Might be the ringleader.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D7E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "53951e38155cda4bbc21aa0443da3912ffc7e55667eae01535d7d227b1e6cac7",
      "english": "How's she suspicious?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D7FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "df832426f56635635fa6dc0f1a492762ba12ddf4087afd889d8fc21300861429",
      "english": "What about him?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D814",
      "source_words_sha256": "057f04c20cc2e4bc08e717966bb58841dfce3cbe439043c4c5216a3a0267bc27",
      "english": "Raid the other rooms?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D830",
      "source_words_sha256": "9f869de3008b4ca66ee08bc65070a916dfafad754445542b78fbaa64591eb279",
      "english": "Right. Next room.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D844",
      "source_words_sha256": "d3bdc91f1a42f6cb645b09d1fe110b272400e69a4ffdfe909e0924758dc112fc",
      "english": "Know that man?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D88C",
      "source_words_sha256": "b3930b5e4dafaeb77015d7c308f71dcb52548774d23962e5c8343ddb0fcf9389",
      "english": "Shinsengumi! Marilyn, you the dealer?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D8B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "3a36f3c0fc7f7ed380bf4dece8bd4f9364dbf56ee17bdd477327afb8248f41d4",
      "english": "Sounds like a huge organization...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D8D8",
      "source_words_sha256": "552dbb65d03bc1f7985ba120b52b9866c51116a981e3145aa0b72f6ed819e239",
      "english": "Careful, Sougo! She's a cyborg!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D904",
      "source_words_sha256": "458b9b4dae4f00ba3d94e49f1022f8e1bb3d9a058f65c84c4e456ce88a9c761a",
      "english": "Quiet! You're a dealer trading with Joi rebels!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D93C",
      "source_words_sha256": "5afcb8ff3be593b1f9d0b42e07622cf48c2b8dfa60d267c4e148601eb7b828ba",
      "english": "Then why are you here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D958",
      "source_words_sha256": "c0c13633940f42c11cb80ca8ad6d3c69e279a64fcd14c38f7027a85c3a90ea05",
      "english": "She admits being modified.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D970",
      "source_words_sha256": "40dfeba1049293802a91acaeee773b54c08d7d76598a52172219fdb7b4a4ccc4",
      "english": "Yamazaki! Take her in too!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D98C",
      "source_words_sha256": "f4eb0b41cb0d58c42b0205411a548b1f8a7bcf2491bd375e0ef95098f4ea92d5",
      "english": "Might be the tip of the iceberg.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D9AC",
      "source_words_sha256": "fdac148b47047ab154d4ccd306e3feff7e632e6cad0fe18457bfa982d4f3c20a",
      "english": "Wait. Someone's here.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D9C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "c368ba5493eb815498acb6d5e5f09fd596af5d0a933dacd03996e54316f23775",
      "english": "We're Shinsengumi. Your name?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005D9E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "b79cc5987d6910e51040d5c6ea5d34bbd9dd6a4c5509a650c14789bd5a0eff30",
      "english": "You call these deals mail order?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DA1C",
      "source_words_sha256": "402e306827d4fc41f2758979983821bd7e02504fb54d9424fe24ed7df788d947",
      "english": "Quiet, cyborg! Don't resist!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DA44",
      "source_words_sha256": "e544942c0077d970944446edd70282f9966c996826ed5265845db7fead062853",
      "english": "Is she really a dealer?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DA5C",
      "source_words_sha256": "f7b622cfa03f079c7382fc03eef1edfb653a179b81f1036b953f0b9afb57e674",
      "english": "Take her in!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DA6C",
      "source_words_sha256": "905f13b2c409fe9e192bc742d87b626074d21bda0ee62f90108a457aab98c723",
      "english": "Right! Next room!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DA84",
      "source_words_sha256": "8307ddc5228b2390e21680f8a277c60253077de4aacb9c70cbfdabcf7cde728c",
      "english": "Was that Michael's voice?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DAA8",
      "source_words_sha256": "608563bf7f182721f2f58e210ae82f3605ae09e507078bc9e197ed43b68c6e9c",
      "english": "That man? You mean Michael?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DAC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "1e6453f020356ccabe90f149eabe1f890827e610f706f0dbcf3d6864f55238d7",
      "english": "Know him? We work together.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DAE8",
      "source_words_sha256": "2b6c42c125e867d5876c549c6398ffd21a583f1a2c83729f1ab355aacbb36d03",
      "english": "Marilyn. Never heard of me?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DB04",
      "source_words_sha256": "4ce28efd99aba4ac4fd16b3ce6bf1de34fc18ae4cd95d3c11b26930465066f92",
      "english": "Yes, I do work in mail-order sales...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DB30",
      "source_words_sha256": "65075a3c119164106daea7dc0ea11538a2dd43f7e1c069ff3dcca7ad06783af8",
      "english": "A dealer? Well, yes, I sell things for a living...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DB74",
      "source_words_sha256": "2075597fa602276140c375e35c3f206b961d7df76b03d54f65dfa03a4bf27bc2",
      "english": "Loads of people! It's a nationwide network!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DBD4",
      "source_words_sha256": "f83c477106f3d2d5be6b1fb5ad792120bbe81b599e0fee385fc649ab389061c1",
      "english": "What?! Michael told you that, didn't he?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0005DC00",
      "source_words_sha256": "b0ca85afd50c91b329fabbdda0fa1f63858fb67f87b4ef3f8b66c59e5ec1bcdd",
      "english": "I told you! Only my NOSE is done, bastard!",
      "translator_note": null
    }
  ]
}
